{"id":313,"gn":"Pokémon Luciole","ft":["Il communique avec ses pairs en allumant son postérieur la nuit. Il adore le doux parfum de Lumivole.","Il vit aux abords des étangs. La nuit, son corps émet de la lumière pour communiquer avec d’autres Muciole.","À la tombée de la nuit, la queue de Muciole émet de la lumière. Il communique avec les autres en ajustant l’intensité et le clignotement de sa lumière. Ce Pokémon est attiré par le doux parfum de Lumivole.","La queue de Muciole éclaire comme une ampoule. Ensemble, les Muciole dessinent des figures géométriques dans la nuit étoilée. Ce Pokémon adore le parfum dégagé par Lumivole."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":2,"26":3},"gr":0,"cr":150,"hc":15,"bh":70,"eg":["Insectoïde","Humanoïde"],"gw":"slow-then-very-fast","gm":{"svmask":[0,9],"sv":[1,9],"oras":[0,89],"xy":[0,133],"e":[0,86],"rs":[0,86]},"f":{"313":{"n":"Muciole","t":["bug"],"s":[65,73,75,47,85,85],"h":0.7,"w":17.7,"a":[[35,0],[68,0],[158,1]],"ps":[[6,[65,73,55,47,75,85]]],"pa":[[4,[[35,0],[68,0]]]],"av":["svmask","sv","oras","xy","e","rs"],"hi":[[190,5,[25,26,27,28,29,30]]],"ls":[{"l":[[33,1],[104,5],[109,8],[98,12],[522,15],[236,19],[294,22],[182,26],[428,29],[270,33],[405,36],[583,40],[38,43],[611,47]],"m":[8,9,34,36,38,76,86,87,109,113,118,129,156,164,168,182,189,202,203,214,226,227,240,241,247,263,264,269,270,271,280,283,314,332,352,366,369,374,403,405,428,450,451,512,522,583,605,679,806,851,884,885,886],"e":[68,69,207,355]},{"l":[[148,1],[33,1],[104,5],[109,8],[98,12],[522,15],[236,19],[294,22],[324,26],[182,29],[428,33],[270,36],[405,40],[583,43],[38,47]],"m":[76,85,86,87,92,104,113,148,156,164,168,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,244,247,263,280,290,332,355,369,374,451,496,512,522,590,605,612],"e":[69,146,226,227,271,318,405],"t":[8,9,173,202,264,270,271,324,351,352,366,428,450]},{"l":[[148,1],[33,1],[104,5],[109,9],[236,13],[98,17],[294,21],[324,25],[182,29],[270,33],[428,37],[405,41],[38,45]],"m":[76,85,86,87,92,104,113,148,156,164,168,182,20